Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you with a flat top! Huh? Yeah, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You threw this trash, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, it's a 500 Singapore\Ndollar fine! No way! 500?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The law here prohibits littering and\Nfines all violators for doing so,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that means you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,500 Singapore dollars is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's gotta be about 40,000\Nyen. Trash? Are you clear? on that, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.38,0:00:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I see on the ground\Nhere is my own luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you've got me a little confused now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you be so kind as to tell me what\Ntrash you're referring to, officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're wrong, then I'm\Nobeying the law, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that bag is your luggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:00:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got to get going, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's still following\Nus like a lost puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you going to see\Nyour father once we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.46,0:01:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop tagging along and go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're here now, so move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm meeting up with him in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can go wherever the hell I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not taking orders from you jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She mustn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be in danger if she stays with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe she lacks the\Ncash for a place to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.72,0:01:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to get her a\Nhotel room for a few nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get her to come with us and\Ntry not to bruise her ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.86,0:01:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're stinking poor, aren't?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:01:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider this your lucky day, freeloader.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:01:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:02:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chicken. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, sir, but we tend\Nto be full at this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We no longer have any\Nlarge suites available.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I suggest our double rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we're
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, for the rooms, uh, Avdol and I\Nwill share a room with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd make sense for Jotaro and I to\Nshare a room, since we're both students.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that help, Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the last room goes\Nto Polnareff, and... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I'd room with that guy! You brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she may be a child, but let's\Ngive the young lady her own room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, we'll take four rooms, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I can relax more\Nin my own room anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sleep like a baby tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been through all kinds of hell\Never since the day we left Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should hurry up and take a shower\Nin a place where it's actually safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I should have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you guys at least give us a\Nchance to rest, persistent bastards?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Climb HIKARI YAKU SADAME
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,UCHI Cameo NOAH
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onland, onland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ONLAND ONLAND ONLAND ONLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BREAK YOU DOWN KOMBUSH\NKOMBUSH Take it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be strong to die and die! No!
