Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's some insanely intense\Nbloodlust you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor and tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Polnareff, so you'll\Nknow who sent you to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist, my\Nname is Soul Sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since you're probably wondering,\Nmy stand is the card of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It represents insanity of the cursed and a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,precipitous and malevolent fall into ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But tell me, how did you know\NI was hiding inside the fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you really are that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took everything out of the fridge\Nand didn't bother putting any of it away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.70,0:06:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ebony Devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're really pathetic, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ape on the boat was a far more\Nterrifying stand user than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize that you're\Nworse at this than a monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now look what you've done, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, how dare you do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really, really hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can hold one hell\Nof a grudge against you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such torture, such agony must be avenged!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're the pathetic one, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let you find me and\Nattack me on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead, man now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
