Dialogue: 2,0:07:53.99,0:07:54.03,SFXOang,3,0,0,0,,{=29}{\blur0.9\bord0\fscx130\fscy100\frz337.4\pos(1622.86,700.11)\4a&HFF&}Gush!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did he cut me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:08:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't think I felt an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.87,0:08:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand user was here ready to ambush me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that you, Avdol? Anyway, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't figure him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.90,0:08:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell if he was weak or strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow he was able to cut my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The devil card?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's soul sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holnorath, are you absolutely\Npositive that's what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.07,0:08:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm racking my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't see how it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact that I\Ncaught a glimpse of his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I don't remember anything\Nbeing near me, but my leg's been gouged.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But anyway, I should be\Nthere in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.74,0:08:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in room 1212, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the 12th floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contact Kakyoin and Jotaro 2, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Front desk. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this room service?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hurt my leg a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you send up some medicine\Nand bandages as soon as possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Polnareff, room 912.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.93,0:09:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll bring it up immediately, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is the last thing I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how you cut it, dirty underwear\Nmakes for a really shitty band-aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn this hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, I was wondering, do you know\Nabout this guy who attacked Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he is sole sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to rumors, he's a Native\NAmerican shaman who is also an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's an utterly terrifying stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mafias, militaries, politicians,\Nlowlifes the world over hire him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen him before, and he\Nlooks as fierce as his reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body is covered in scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scars he receives by cunningly\Nprovoking his enemy to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how he gets the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He uses the so-called power of\Nvengeance to fully control his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, to ordinary people, it\Nappears that a curse killed the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Polnareff must have fallen\Nfor soul sacrifice's trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that's what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of stand is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because those who've seen it are dead, we\Nhave to decide how we're handling this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.84,0:10:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, it's too dangerous\Nfor Polnareff to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could try to kill us one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's something\Nhe might be able to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to figure out a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be here in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's all meet up in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you in room 1212 soon, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that all about, Jojo? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, we're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.23,0:10:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't find my room key.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I\Nput it down right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I going crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now how the hell am I\Ngoing to get back in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I tell the front\Ndesk and ask for a new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.74,0:11:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's probably a fine\Nfor that. There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have fallen during\Nall the commotion earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to go all\Nthe way to the middle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, shampoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, this is killing my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a sitting duck under here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.09,0:12:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, the front desk sent me up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought you a first aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get yourself killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, what's happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, you'll get yourself killed!
