Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you stab one of my eyes out\Nwhen I hadn't even touched you once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's a doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of stand is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're stupid as you look don't you\Nget it your stand can't fight where you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't see as long as you're tied up\Nunderneath the bed you can't hurt me?
