Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you are here. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave this room for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come for you again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your door locked, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't open it for any strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
