Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How heavy is this bed anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be at least 120 kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can push it off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to use Silver Chariot's\Nsword to cut these cords
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little bastard! As soon as\NI stop attacking, this happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better believe I'm gonna keep blindly\Nstabbing every centimeter of this room!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the big scary\Nknight can't even pin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the tail on the donkey\Nwhen he's blindfolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about dents!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mine now! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just about had it\Nwith you, you little runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the girl with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.01,0:15:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went to her room and\Nmade sure she was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We decided against it because\Nshe would be vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The risk of her falling under attack while\Nwith us is far too great. Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.36,0:15:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're just waiting\Nfor Polnareff to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But man, he's so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already been way over five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out! Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to snap your spear in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I'm finally free of those cords.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've got to send Chariot under the\Nbed and get myself the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.19,0:16:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Polnareff, how would you like it\Nif I took a bite out of your balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that a doll could\Nbe such an obscene little jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run off to a\Nplace you can't see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You numbskull!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give the floor you're\Nstuck to a good feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The carpet's soaked with\Nbeer, juice, and alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a well-stocked\Nbar that I put to good use!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had piss in me, I would have\Nsoaked you in it to make it even wetter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.94,0:17:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, a hairdryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's lit up like a fireworks\Nshow at a summer festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so many uses for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one do you think I'm\Ngoing to pick, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can style that\Nridiculous hair of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to put an end to this curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet your maker, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.94,0:18:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm, you're not the only one who can break\Nstuff, you satanic little pincushiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you know precisely\Nwhere I was on top of the bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trapped you underneath it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple, I broke all the mirrors, so\NI could see you hanging over the bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clear as day from down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sucks to be you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.72,0:18:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seek a man with two right hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has something to answer for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save me some trouble and tell\Nme what his stand is. You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No assassin worth a damn would\Never reveal his stand's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only happens in the face of\Ncertain death for him or his opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are so stupid, always showing\Noff your stands everywhere you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:19:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault that we know all your\Nweaknesses if it weren't for that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have killed you You're\Njust a moron who got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter didn't\Nyou say you were going
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to bite off my balls\Nor something tough guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare you you vulgar little shit.
