Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get right to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.12,0:19:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's figure out what our strategy\Nwill be of soul-sacrifice attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're...
