Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.68,0:20:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why was there a dead\Nboy's body in your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about the dead body\Nthat was in the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two are connected, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the right to\Nremain silent, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had the Speedwagon\NFoundation strike a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff should be released soon\Nenough, without too much hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that was cutting\Nit close, even for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think that the enemy's\Npursuit would come so early on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.88,0:20:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that Dio's body used\Nto belong to Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While they're united, he'll\Nknow everything Jotaro and I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why his minions'\Nattacks are relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:21:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can use that against him and\Nread his thoughts just as he reads ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.15,0:21:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I go buy a camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use my powers even\Nwithout a camera. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Michael is still not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.70,0:21:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This week's number three jumps\Nup five points from last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In trading, the price\Nof gold today wrote...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The channels are changing as if\Nthe TV has a mind of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's searching for words from among the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,channels and connecting\Nthem into a sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Creating a message for\Nthe ear not the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There I think the first part is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.34,0:22:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is wait what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did it just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.06,0:22:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could be wrong but I think it said that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.12,0:22:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is a traitor who\Nis walking among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.04,0:22:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin? What? It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.16,0:22:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin is Dio's servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.42,0:22:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.24,0:22:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He found us! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that can't be true, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know as well as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple says Kakyoin is a traitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a servant to Dio who will at\Nsome point betray all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:22:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:23:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't believe Kakyoin is a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.10,0:23:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to be even more alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.32,0:23:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he is still connected with Dio,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.08,0:23:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he could exterminate any one\Nof us while we're sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.14,0:23:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd be just like Dio's\Nvery own Trojan horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.94,0:23:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, where is Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.86,0:23:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's with Jotaro.
